      <p class="paragraph candlehowtouse"><strong>How to use<br>‍<br></strong>Remove the dust cover and let the candle burn for at least 2 hours the first time until the top layer melts into a pool of wax.<br><br>After the first use, burning time can range from 1 - 2 hours. Always allow the top layer of wax to fully melt before extinguishing.<br>‍<br>Trim the wick before the next use as this will ensure and even burn and consistent scent throw.<br>‍<br>Candles can be used to create a sacred space for yoga, massage, meditation and self-care rituals, restoring a sense of balance within.</p>
